{"step_index":1586,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:02:07Z","thinking":"Examining the dataset, \"무몽크\" is identified as a well-known jazz venue located in Busan's Geumjeong-gu district. Another entry, \"거창레코드,\" is also categorized as music-related, and situated in Busan's Busanjin-gu district. Comparing the category data and location information will allow identification of potentially related entities within the dataset.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Search Daum for music companies","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction searchDaum(q) {\n  return new Promise(resolve => {\n    https.get('https://search.daum.net/search?w=tot&q=' + encodeURIComponent(q), {\n      headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36' }\n    }, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => {\n        const text = d.replace(/<script[\\s\\S]*?<\\/script>/gi, '').replace(/<style[\\s\\S]*?<\\/style>/gi, '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n        const m = d.match(/\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}\\b/g) || [];\n        console.log(`[Daum] \"${q}\" -> biz:`, [...new Set(m)]);\n        // Look for place/local snippet\n        const idx = text.indexOf('도로명') !== -1 ? text.indexOf('도로명') : text.indexOf(q.split(' ')[0]);\n        if (idx !== -1) {\n          console.log(`   Text:`, text.slice(idx, idx + 250));\n        }\n        resolve();\n      });\n    }).on('error', () => resolve());\n  });\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n  await searchDaum('무몽크 부산');\n  await searchDaum('거창레코드 부전동');\n  await searchDaum('동화사 초량동');\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Search Daum for music venues and publishers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\search_music_daum.js","toolAction":"Create search_music_daum.js","toolSummary":"Create search_music_daum.js"}}]}
