{"step_index":1592,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:02:25Z","thinking":"Analyzing company data, specifically focusing on address details. Noticed \"시드게임즈\" and \"스튜디오비오\" share the same street address, albeit in different buildings within the \"수영강변대로 140\" complex. \"하드롤게임즈\" is also present within the same dataset, though no address has been extracted yet.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test GRAC search for game developers","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction testGrac(name) {\n  return new Promise(resolve => {\n    // GRAC game rating search\n    const url = 'https://www.grac.or.kr/Board/GameSearch.aspx?searchtext=' + encodeURIComponent(name);\n    https.get(url, {\n      headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0' }\n    }, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => {\n        console.log(`[GRAC] \"${name}\" Status: ${res.statusCode}, Length: ${d.length}`);\n        const rows = d.match(/<tr[\\s\\S]*?<\\/tr>/gi) || [];\n        console.log(`[GRAC] Rows count: ${rows.length}`);\n        rows.slice(0, 3).forEach(r => console.log('   Row:', r.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')));\n        resolve();\n      });\n    }).on('error', () => resolve());\n  });\n}\n\ntestGrac('시드게임즈');\n","Description":"Test GRAC rating search","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\test_grac.js","toolAction":"Create test_grac.js","toolSummary":"Create test_grac.js"}}]}
